.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">纳多德NADDOD</a></div><div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-4 text-xs leading-6 text-[#aeb3bd] lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2"><span>© 2026 武汉超擎数智科技有限公司 版权所有</span><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">鄂ICP备18001238号-2</a></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2"><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="/contact">联系我们</a><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="/terms-of-use">用户协议</a><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="/privacy-policy">隐私政策</a><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="/legal-notice">法律声明</a></div></div></div></div></footer></div></body></html>